    "id": "LVMC-11-52-130-A11",
    "title": "Posted places (A)(11)",
    "text": "No person shall stop, stand or park a vehicle except when necessary to avoid conflict with other traffic in compliance with law or the directions of a police officer or a traffic control device, in any of the following places: Within fifteen feet of an intersection.",
    "source": "LVMC 11.52.130(A)(11)"
  },
